* Physical Behavioral Model for 74LVC1G123 Monostable (Calibrated 100 ns Gate)
* Mapped Pins: 1=Abar, 2=B, 3=CLRbar, 5=Q, 6=Cext, 7=RCext

.SUBCKT 74LVC1G123 Abar B CLRbar Q Cext RCext

C_A Abar 0 4P
C_B B 0 4P
C_CLR CLRbar 0 4P

* Continuous Threshold Evaluators
E_B  B_DET  0 TABLE { V(B) }      = (0, 0) (1.3, 0) (1.5, 3.3) (5, 3.3)
E_A  A_DET  0 TABLE { V(Abar) }   = (0, 3.3) (1.3, 3.3) (1.5, 0) (5, 0)
E_C  C_DET  0 TABLE { V(CLRbar) } = (0, 0) (1.3, 0) (1.5, 3.3) (5, 3.3)

* Logic AND Engine
E_TRIG TRIG_INT 0 VALUE = { (V(B_DET) * V(A_DET) * V(C_DET)) / 10.89 }

* Calibrated 100 ns Internal Stretcher Node:
* R = 1k, C = 100pF -> Tau = 100 ns time constant
R_TIMING TRIG_INT PULSE_NODE 1K
C_TIMING PULSE_NODE 0 100P

* Bounded Threshold Switch: Output stays HIGH until PULSE_NODE decays past 1.21V (approx. 1 Tau = 100 ns)
E_OUT Q_INT 0 TABLE { V(PULSE_NODE) } = (0, 0) (1.2, 0) (1.22, 3.3) (5, 3.3)

* Physical Output Driver (25 Ohm CMOS series resistance)
R_OUT Q_INT Q 25
C_OUT Q 0 10P

.ENDS 74LVC1G123
